{"seq":4,"slug":"joins","title":"连接查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/sql-fundamentals/joins","wordCount":862,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"连接查询\">连接查询</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>连接（JOIN）是关系数据库的核心操作，将两个或多个表中的数据按关联条件组合成一个结果集。理解不同连接类型的语义和性能特征是写出正确且高效 SQL 的基础。连接的本质是笛卡尔积加过滤——先产生所有行的组合，再通过 ON 条件筛选匹配的行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph INNER JOIN&#10;        A1[表 A ∩ 表 B]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph LEFT JOIN&#10;        B1[表 A 全部 + 表 B 匹配]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph RIGHT JOIN&#10;        C1[表 A 匹配 + 表 B 全部]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph FULL JOIN&#10;        D1[表 A 全部 + 表 B 全部]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph CROSS JOIN&#10;        E1[表 A × 表 B 笛卡尔积]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph INNER JOIN\n        A1[表 A ∩ 表 B]\n    end\n\n    subgraph LEFT JOIN\n        B1[表 A 全部 + 表 B 匹配]\n    end\n\n    subgraph RIGHT JOIN\n        C1[表 A 匹配 + 表 B 全部]\n    end\n\n    subgraph FULL JOIN\n        D1[表 A 全部 + 表 B 全部]\n    end\n\n    subgraph CROSS JOIN\n        E1[表 A × 表 B 笛卡尔积]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>连接类型</th>\n<th>不匹配的行</th>\n<th>NULL 填充</th>\n<th>结果集大小</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>INNER JOIN</td>\n<td>丢弃</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>≤ min(A, B)</td>\n<td>严格匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LEFT JOIN</td>\n<td>保留左表</td>\n<td>右表列填 NULL</td>\n<td>≥ A</td>\n<td>主表 + 可选关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RIGHT JOIN</td>\n<td>保留右表</td>\n<td>左表列填 NULL</td>\n<td>≥ B</td>\n<td>少用，可改写为 LEFT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FULL OUTER JOIN</td>\n<td>两表都保留</td>\n<td>不匹配侧填 NULL</td>\n<td>≥ max(A, B)</td>\n<td>差异比对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CROSS JOIN</td>\n<td>全组合</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>A × B</td>\n<td>日期维度表生成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"inner-join-内连接\">INNER JOIN 内连接</h2><p>INNER JOIN 是最常用的连接类型，只返回两个表中满足连接条件的行。如果一行在另一个表中没有匹配，该行不出现在结果中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const innerJoinExamples = `&#10;-- 基础 INNER JOIN&#10;SELECT &#10;    o.order_id,&#10;    o.amount,&#10;    u.username,&#10;    u.email&#10;FROM orders o&#10;INNER JOIN users u ON o.user_id = u.user_id;&#10;&#10;-- 多表连接&#10;SELECT &#10;    o.order_id,&#10;    u.username,&#10;    p.product_name,&#10;    oi.quantity,&#10;    oi.unit_price,&#10;    (oi.quantity * oi.unit_price) AS line_total&#10;FROM orders o&#10;INNER JOIN users u ON o.user_id = u.user_id&#10;INNER JOIN order_items oi ON o.order_id = oi.order_id&#10;INNER JOIN products p ON oi.product_id = p.product_id&#10;WHERE o.status = 1;&#10;&#10;-- 非等值连接（较少见但有用）&#10;SELECT &#10;    e.employee_name,&#10;    sg.grade_level&#10;FROM employees e&#10;INNER JOIN salary_grades sg &#10;    ON e.salary BETWEEN sg.min_salary AND sg.max_salary;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> innerJoinExamples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 基础 INNER JOIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    o.order_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    o.amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    u.username,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    u.email</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INNER JOIN users u ON o.user_id = u.user_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 多表连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    o.order_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    u.username,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    p.product_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    oi.quantity,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    oi.unit_price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    (oi.quantity * oi.unit_price) AS line_total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INNER JOIN users u ON o.user_id = u.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INNER JOIN order_items oi ON o.order_id = oi.order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INNER JOIN products p ON oi.product_id = p.product_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE o.status = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 非等值连接（较少见但有用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    e.employee_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    sg.grade_level</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM employees e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INNER JOIN salary_grades sg </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ON e.salary BETWEEN sg.min_salary AND sg.max_salary;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>INNER JOIN 的连接顺序在逻辑上不影响结果，但优化器会根据统计信息选择最优的物理执行顺序。小表驱动大表（小表作为外循环）通常更高效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"left-join-外连接\">LEFT JOIN 外连接</h2><p>LEFT JOIN 保留左表的所有行，右表没有匹配的行用 NULL 填充。这是&quot;主表 + 可选关联&quot;场景的标准解法。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const leftJoinExamples = `&#10;-- 用户及其订单（包括没有订单的用户）&#10;SELECT &#10;    u.user_id,&#10;    u.username,&#10;    COUNT(o.order_id) AS order_count,&#10;    COALESCE(SUM(o.amount), 0) AS total_spent&#10;FROM users u&#10;LEFT JOIN orders o ON u.user_id = o.user_id&#10;GROUP BY u.user_id, u.username;&#10;&#10;-- 查找没有匹配的行（反连接 Anti-Join）&#10;SELECT u.user_id, u.username&#10;FROM users u&#10;LEFT JOIN orders o ON u.user_id = o.user_id&#10;WHERE o.order_id IS NULL;&#10;&#10;-- 等价的 NOT EXISTS 写法（通常性能更好）&#10;SELECT u.user_id, u.username&#10;FROM users u&#10;WHERE NOT EXISTS (&#10;    SELECT 1 FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id&#10;);&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> leftJoinExamples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 用户及其订单（包括没有订单的用户）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    u.user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    u.username,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(o.order_id) AS order_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COALESCE(SUM(o.amount), 0) AS total_spent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LEFT JOIN orders o ON u.user_id = o.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY u.user_id, u.username;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 查找没有匹配的行（反连接 Anti-Join）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT u.user_id, u.username</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LEFT JOIN orders o ON u.user_id = o.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE o.order_id IS NULL;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 等价的 NOT EXISTS 写法（通常性能更好）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT u.user_id, u.username</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE NOT EXISTS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT 1 FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>LEFT JOIN 的常见陷阱是在 WHERE 子句中对右表列进行非 NULL 过滤，这会将 LEFT JOIN 退化为 INNER JOIN：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>写法</th>\n<th>实际效果</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>LEFT JOIN b ON ... WHERE b.col = 1</code></td>\n<td>等价于 INNER JOIN</td>\n<td>NULL = 1 为 UNKNOWN，不匹配行被过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LEFT JOIN b ON ... WHERE b.col IS NULL</code></td>\n<td>反连接</td>\n<td>仅保留右表无匹配的行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LEFT JOIN b ON ... AND b.col = 1</code></td>\n<td>真正的 LEFT JOIN 过滤</td>\n<td>条件放在 ON 中不影响左表保留</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cross-join-与-lateral\">CROSS JOIN 与 LATERAL</h2><p>CROSS JOIN 产生两表的笛卡尔积，每一行与另一表的所有行组合。虽然通常应避免无条件笛卡尔积，但在特定场景下非常有用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const crossJoinExamples = `&#10;-- 生成日期维度表&#10;SELECT d.date_val, h.hour_val&#10;FROM generate_series(&#39;2024-01-01&#39;::DATE, &#39;2024-12-31&#39;::DATE, &#39;1 day&#39;) AS d(date_val)&#10;CROSS JOIN generate_series(0, 23) AS h(hour_val);&#10;&#10;-- 每个用户 × 每个产品类别 的评分矩阵（包括未评分的组合）&#10;SELECT &#10;    u.user_id,&#10;    c.category_id,&#10;    COALESCE(r.avg_rating, 0) AS avg_rating&#10;FROM users u&#10;CROSS JOIN categories c&#10;LEFT JOIN (&#10;    SELECT user_id, category_id, AVG(rating) AS avg_rating&#10;    FROM reviews&#10;    GROUP BY user_id, category_id&#10;) r ON u.user_id = r.user_id AND c.category_id = r.category_id;&#10;`;&#10;&#10;// LATERAL JOIN（PostgreSQL）— 子查询可以引用外部表&#10;const lateralJoin = `&#10;-- 每个用户的最近 3 笔订单&#10;SELECT u.user_id, u.username, recent.*&#10;FROM users u&#10;CROSS JOIN LATERAL (&#10;    SELECT order_id, amount, created_at&#10;    FROM orders o&#10;    WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id&#10;    ORDER BY o.created_at DESC&#10;    LIMIT 3&#10;) recent;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> crossJoinExamples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 生成日期维度表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT d.date_val, h.hour_val</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM generate_series('2024-01-01'::DATE, '2024-12-31'::DATE, '1 day') AS d(date_val)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CROSS JOIN generate_series(0, 23) AS h(hour_val);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 每个用户 × 每个产品类别 的评分矩阵（包括未评分的组合）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    u.user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    c.category_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COALESCE(r.avg_rating, 0) AS avg_rating</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CROSS JOIN categories c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LEFT JOIN (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT user_id, category_id, AVG(rating) AS avg_rating</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM reviews</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY user_id, category_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) r ON u.user_id = r.user_id AND c.category_id = r.category_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// LATERAL JOIN（PostgreSQL）— 子查询可以引用外部表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lateralJoin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 每个用户的最近 3 笔订单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT u.user_id, u.username, recent.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CROSS JOIN LATERAL (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT order_id, amount, created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ORDER BY o.created_at DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    LIMIT 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) recent;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>LATERAL JOIN 是 SQL 中极为强大的特性，它允许子查询引用外部查询的列。这在&quot;每组取 Top N&quot;等场景中比窗口函数方案更直观高效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自连接与递归关系\">自连接与递归关系</h2><p>自连接（Self Join）是表与自身的连接，用于处理层级关系、时序比较等场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const selfJoinExamples = `&#10;-- 组织架构层级&#10;SELECT &#10;    e.employee_name AS employee,&#10;    m.employee_name AS manager&#10;FROM employees e&#10;LEFT JOIN employees m ON e.manager_id = m.employee_id;&#10;&#10;-- 同一天相邻订单的金额差异&#10;SELECT &#10;    a.order_id,&#10;    a.amount,&#10;    b.order_id AS next_order_id,&#10;    b.amount AS next_amount,&#10;    (b.amount - a.amount) AS amount_diff&#10;FROM orders a&#10;INNER JOIN orders b &#10;    ON a.user_id = b.user_id &#10;    AND a.created_at &lt; b.created_at&#10;    AND NOT EXISTS (&#10;        SELECT 1 FROM orders c&#10;        WHERE c.user_id = a.user_id&#10;        AND c.created_at &gt; a.created_at&#10;        AND c.created_at &lt; b.created_at&#10;    );&#10;&#10;-- 查找重复数据&#10;SELECT a.email, COUNT(*) AS duplicate_count&#10;FROM users a&#10;INNER JOIN users b &#10;    ON a.email = b.email &#10;    AND a.user_id &lt; b.user_id&#10;GROUP BY a.email;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> selfJoinExamples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 组织架构层级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    e.employee_name AS employee,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    m.employee_name AS manager</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM employees e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LEFT JOIN employees m ON e.manager_id = m.employee_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 同一天相邻订单的金额差异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    a.order_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    a.amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    b.order_id AS next_order_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    b.amount AS next_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    (b.amount - a.amount) AS amount_diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM orders a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INNER JOIN orders b </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ON a.user_id = b.user_id </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    AND a.created_at &#x3C; b.created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    AND NOT EXISTS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        SELECT 1 FROM orders c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHERE c.user_id = a.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        AND c.created_at > a.created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        AND c.created_at &#x3C; b.created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 查找重复数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT a.email, COUNT(*) AS duplicate_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INNER JOIN users b </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ON a.email = b.email </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    AND a.user_id &#x3C; b.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY a.email;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"连接性能优化\">连接性能优化</h2><p>连接的性能取决于连接算法、索引设计和数据量。数据库优化器通常在三种物理连接算法中选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>内存需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Nested Loop</td>\n<td>小表连接大表（有索引）</td>\n<td>O(N × M) 最坏</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hash Join</td>\n<td>大表等值连接（无索引）</td>\n<td>O(N + M)</td>\n<td>高（需构建哈希表）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Merge Join</td>\n<td>大表等值连接（已排序）</td>\n<td>O(N + M)</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const performanceTips = `&#10;-- 确保连接列有索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_orders_user_id ON orders(user_id);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_order_items_order_id ON order_items(order_id);&#10;&#10;-- 避免在 ON 条件中使用函数（破坏索引利用）&#10;-- 差：ON LOWER(a.email) = LOWER(b.email)&#10;-- 好：ON a.email = b.email （存储时已统一为小写）&#10;&#10;-- 多表连接时，WHERE 条件尽早过滤减少中间结果集&#10;SELECT o.order_id, p.product_name&#10;FROM orders o&#10;INNER JOIN order_items oi ON o.order_id = oi.order_id&#10;INNER JOIN products p ON oi.product_id = p.product_id&#10;WHERE o.created_at &gt;= &#39;2024-01-01&#39;  -- 尽早缩小 orders 范围&#10;  AND p.category_id = 5;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> performanceTips</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 确保连接列有索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_orders_user_id ON orders(user_id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_order_items_order_id ON order_items(order_id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 避免在 ON 条件中使用函数（破坏索引利用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 差：ON LOWER(a.email) = LOWER(b.email)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 好：ON a.email = b.email （存储时已统一为小写）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 多表连接时，WHERE 条件尽早过滤减少中间结果集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT o.order_id, p.product_name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INNER JOIN order_items oi ON o.order_id = oi.order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INNER JOIN products p ON oi.product_id = p.product_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE o.created_at >= '2024-01-01'  -- 尽早缩小 orders 范围</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  AND p.category_id = 5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>INNER JOIN 只返回匹配行，LEFT JOIN 保留左表全部行并对不匹配用 NULL 填充</li>\n<li>LEFT JOIN + WHERE 右表列 IS NULL 实现反连接（Anti-Join），但 NOT EXISTS 通常性能更好</li>\n<li>WHERE 子句中对 LEFT JOIN 右表列的非 NULL 过滤会使 LEFT JOIN 退化为 INNER JOIN</li>\n<li>CROSS JOIN 用于笛卡尔积场景，如维度表生成和矩阵填充</li>\n<li>LATERAL JOIN 允许子查询引用外部列，是&quot;每组取 Top N&quot;的高效解法</li>\n<li>连接列必须有索引，ON 条件中避免函数调用，优化器在 Nested Loop / Hash Join / Merge Join 三种算法中选择</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"连接查询","id":"连接查询"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"INNER JOIN 内连接","id":"inner-join-内连接"},{"level":2,"text":"LEFT JOIN 外连接","id":"left-join-外连接"},{"level":2,"text":"CROSS JOIN 与 LATERAL","id":"cross-join-与-lateral"},{"level":2,"text":"自连接与递归关系","id":"自连接与递归关系"},{"level":2,"text":"连接性能优化","id":"连接性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"条件过滤与排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/sql-fundamentals/filtering-and-sorting"},"next":{"title":"子查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/advanced-queries/subqueries"}}